# Break Out on turn 3 looks at the top six: Lightning Bolt, Elvish Mystic, Brazen Borrower, then three Forests. Bot1 reveals
# the Elvish Mystic (the Bolt, not a creature card, is refused; the Mystic is the control), mana value 1, and chooses to put
# it onto the battlefield: it gains haste until end of turn, so it attacks at once for 1. It is not also put into the hand.
# By turn 5 the haste has worn off (until end of turn, CR 514.2). The library began with 12 cards: two were drawn (turns 3
# and 5) and the Mystic taken, so 9 remain, the five other looked-at cards among them (on the bottom).

